'''Akira''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] and [[WAVE BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|WAVE BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] gains [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies, but loses [[Strengthen]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

