==Talents==
*'''[[Freeze|Freeze]]''': Adds a 40% chance to freeze for 39f <sup>1.3s</sup>, improves by 9f <sup>0.3s</sup> per level up to 120f <sup>4s</sup> (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Strengthen|Attack Up]]''': Adds 23% attack power at 33% health, increases by 3% per level up to 50% (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Survive|Survives]]''': Adds a 28% chance to survive a lethal strike, improves by 8% per level up to 100% (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)

===Ultra Talents===
*'''Target [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]''' (Cost: 150 NP)
*'''[[Surge Attacks|Surge Attack]]''': Adds a 10% chance to create a level 1 surge attack between 430~780 range, improves by 10% per level up to 100% (Total Cost: 285 NP)

