==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Akira was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Just Us League (Removed Combo)|Just Us League]] and [[Revengers (Removed Combo)|Revengers]].
*Akira gained [[Immune to Weaken]] in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].
*Prior to [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], Shadow Akira was not Immune to Waves.
*He was one of the first units to receive Ultra Talents, alongside [[Megidora (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Megidora]] and [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kuu γ]].
*This unit might be inspired by X and Zero from the ''[[wikipedia:Mega Man|Rockman/Megaman]]'' franchise. The arm cannon is their common trait and his Evolved Form's and True Form's hair is quite similar to Zero's.
*This unit's name may be a reference to the popular Japanese sci-fi franchise ''[[wikipedia:Akira (franchise)|Akira]]''.
*Inferno Akira is one of the units to have his description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "immune to wave attacks" was changed to "Immune to Waves".

